  "question": {
    "text": "<math><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> is a square and <math><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi></math> are the mid points of the sides <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;respectively, then the ratio of the areas of the square and the triangle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></math> is"
  },
