  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the coordinates of the vertices <math> <mrow> <mi>O</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow> </math> be <math> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced> <mrow> <mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced> <mrow> <mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi></mrow> </mfenced><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfenced> <mrow> <mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow> </mfenced><mo>,</mo></mrow> </math> respectively. Then, we get the coordinates of <math><mi>M</mi></math> as <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math> and those of <math><mi>N</mi></math> as <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0043_288744e44527.jpg\" /><br /><br />Therefore, area of <math><mo>∆</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math> is<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Area of the square is <math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>.<br /><br />Hence, the required ratio is <math><mn>8</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></math>"
  }
